      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "(Translate)\n\nDescription\n\nOperating Environment\n\nOpen Beta\n\nQuest 3\n\nVia Virtual Desktop – Wireless connection\n\nSituation\n\nApproximately 20 hours\n\nPreviously, my right hand would not move at all,\n\nso I was unable to open menus etc. using the ‘USE’ gesture,\n\nwhich meant I had to rely on hand tracking or one-handed operation.\n\nQuest behaviour: SteamVR screen? It is possible to display the Quest screen.\n\nIn that state, I have confirmed that the controller is functioning normally.\n\nSteps to Reproduce\n\nWorkaround\n\nNone\n\nSteps to Reproduce\n\nQuest 3\n\n→ Virtual Desktop\n\n→ Wireless connection\n\n→ Launch SteamVR\n\n→ Launch VRChat\n\n→ Play as normal\n\n→ Allow approximately 20 hours to elapse\n\n→ One of the hands becomes locked in the ‘USE’ pose of its own accord\n\nDetails\n\nCategory: Other\n\nFrequency: Occasionally",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
